mlmmj version 1.2.19

I have created a control/modonlypost file, and I have control/moderators
with four entries. 

With this setup, posts from non-moderators are still let through.  So I
created a control/moderated - posts from non-moderators are now
withheld, but so are posts from moderators.   control/access has a list
of miscellaneous restrictions, ending with "allow". 

The aim is to have a list open for all subscribers, but with postings
from moderators only. 


